{
    "title": "Themepack - App Icons, Widgets",
    "description": "Themepack - App Icons,Widgets is an app for Android devices that enables the freedom to change home screen themes, with <b> 10000+ functional widgets, icons, and wallpapers, </b> as well as personalized widgets and icons customization options.\ud83c\udfa8 Looking to be the designer of your home screen, or have a theme pack that reflects your style?(\uff61\u2022\u0300\u1d17-)\u2727 Themepack - App Icons, Widgets enhances the functionality of customizing the device's home screen, making it the perfect choice for you!\r\n\r\n<b> Stylish & Custom Widgets </b>\r\nA variety of widgets, including battery widgets\ud83d\udd0bdisplaying device power information, dynamic image effect widgets          \u0e51\u4e5b\u25e1\u4e5b\u0e51, calendar\ud83d\udcc5, clock\u23f0, weather\ud83c\udf1e, and control panel \ud83d\udcbb widgets. These effects will change the traditional screen appearance, providing you with a surprise! Additionally, you can open your gallery, select images, and customize your widgets, showcasing your creativity!\r\n\r\n<b> DIY Icons </b>\r\nMoreover, you can also customize icons in Themepack - App Icons, Widgets, which offers a variety of choices for icon styles, fonts, colors, transparency levels, background colors, and more! It enables you to create your distinctive icons and rename icons using cool fonts to match your desired device applications, achieving DIY freedom!\r\n\r\n<b> Visual Aesthetics </b>\r\nIn Themepack - App Icons, Widgets, you will find aesthetic backgrounds, K-pop wallpapers, anime, neon, sports, and festival themes to help you customize your home screen with one-click additions, saving you time and effort! This is the unique advantage of Themepack - App Icons, Widgets!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08Why Use Themepack - App Icons, Widgets\u2728\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Various widget functions and rich themes\uff01\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Exquisite icon packs!\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Personalization customized for you!\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Awesome designed wallpapers!\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Easy one-click replacement!\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Super fast update speed!\r\n\r\nNeed to familiarize yourself with how to use it? Step-by-step guide! \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16How to Use Themepack - App Icons, Widgets\r\n\r\n1. Search for Themepack - App Icons, Widgets and download it\r\n2. Open Themepack - App Icons, Widgets\r\n3. Choose the icon packs, themes, widgets, and DIY widgets that you like\r\n4. Replace your choice with one click!\r\n\r\nMore advantages! Carefully unique design!\r\n\r\nAll app icons, themes, widgets, and wallpapers of Themepack - App Icons and widgets are created by top designers! Each widget has a unique meaning, maybe a circle, maybe a rectangle, enough for you to customize!\r\n\r\nWhat should I do if there is a problem?\r\n\r\nContact us\r\nThemepack - App Icons, Widgets to help and guide you! If there is any operation problem, you can send it to us, we will follow up and solve it in time.\r\nEmail address\uff1axmind0303@gmail.com",
